 "layout": "rank-indexed arrays: index 0 = real part, index a = e_a (a = 1..n). n = number of imaginary units.",
 "rule": "e_a * e_b = sgn(b - a) * e_b for a != b; e_a * e_a = -1. Bilinear; 1 is the identity.",
